sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as AI Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant HdrGuard as maas-headers-guard<br/>Plugin
    participant Resolver as model-provider-resolver<br/>Plugin
    participant Stream as stream-usage-enforcer<br/>Plugin
    participant Translate as api-translation<br/>Plugin
    participant AuthInject as apikey-injection<br/>Plugin
    participant Provider as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 1: External Model Inference Request

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (platform auth)
    Gateway->>HdrGuard: ext_proc gRPC/9004<br/>Istio mTLS

    Note over HdrGuard: Captures & strips<br/>x-maas-* headers<br/>→ stores in CycleState

    HdrGuard->>Resolver: CycleState passthrough

    Note over Resolver: Resolves model name<br/>→ weighted provider selection<br/>→ sets x-ipp-selected-provider header<br/>→ writes provider/auth/endpoint to CycleState

    Resolver->>Stream: CycleState passthrough

    Note over Stream: If streaming request:<br/>injects stream_options.include_usage=true

    Stream->>Translate: CycleState passthrough

    Note over Translate: Translates request body<br/>OpenAI ↔ Anthropic Messages ↔ Vertex AI<br/>based on input/output format pair in CycleState

    Translate->>AuthInject: CycleState passthrough

    Note over AuthInject: Reads Secret ref from CycleState<br/>Injects auth header:<br/>• API Key (Authorization: Bearer)<br/>• AWS SigV4 (Authorization + x-amz-*)<br/>• GCP OAuth2 (Authorization: Bearer)

    AuthInject-->>Gateway: ext_proc response<br/>mutated headers + body
    Gateway->>Provider: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+ (Istio DestinationRule SIMPLE)<br/>Auth header injected
    Provider-->>Gateway: LLM Response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 2: ExternalProvider Reconciliation

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over K8sAPI: ExternalProvider CR created/updated

    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: ExternalProvider Controller watches
    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create ExternalName Service<br/>(Kubernetes DNS resolution)
    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create Istio ServiceEntry<br/>(mesh-external resolution)
    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create DestinationRule<br/>(TLS origination SIMPLE)

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 3: ExternalModel Reconciliation

    Note over K8sAPI: ExternalModel CR created/updated

    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: ExternalModel Controller watches
    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Get referenced ExternalProvider
    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>(per-provider rules with<br/>x-ipp-selected-provider match)

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 4: Optional Metering

    participant Metering as Metering Service<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over HdrGuard,AuthInject: external-metering plugin (if configured)

    HdrGuard->>Metering: Pre-request: balance check
    Metering-->>HdrGuard: Balance OK / Denied
    AuthInject->>Metering: Post-response: usage report<br/>(tokens consumed)
